name: sim.getModuleInfo
description: 
luaSynopsis: string/int info=sim.getModuleInfo(string moduleName,int infoType)
pythonSynopsis: string/int info=sim.getModuleInfo(string moduleName,int infoType)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. moduleName: the name of the plugin. See sim.getModuleName.
2. infoType: the type of information to retrieve
3. stringInfo: a pointer to a string information, in case the information type is for a string. The user is in charge of releasing the string buffer with sim.releaseBuffer
4. intInfo: a pointer to an integer information, in case the information type is for an integer.
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. -1 in case of an error
